2.6.	User Story
As a registered user, I want to be able to log in to my account so that I can access personalized features and secure information.
As a new user, I want to be able to create a new account so that I can access the platform's features and services.
As a User who has forgotten their password, I want to be able to reset my password so that I can regain access to my account.
As a Registered user, I want to be able to provide feedback on my experience so that I can share my thoughts and contribute to improving the platform.
As a Registered user I want to be able to create a post to sell a product so that I can list my product for sale on the platform.
As a Registered user I want to be able to update details of my selling post so that I can modify information about the product or adjust the selling terms.
As a Registered user I want to be able to delete a selling post so that I can remove the post from the platform if I no longer want to sell the product.
As a seller I want to be able to guarantee payment so that money will be kept safe and transferred to the seller when the buyer receives the goods as described.
As a seller, I want to be able to link a sales wallet to my account so that I can use it for sales transactions.
As a seller, I want to be able to use the post push service so that my post can be discovered easily by the buyer.
As a seller, I want to be able to confirm the order so that I can recheck the order information.
As a buyer, I want to be able to confirm the order so that I can recheck the order information.
As a buyer, I want to be able to place an order for a product so that I can purchase the desired product and have it delivered.
As a buyer I want to cancel an order so that I can reverse the purchase decision for a specific product.
As a buyer I want to be able to confirm the delivery of a received order so that I can acknowledge the successful receipt of the products.
As a buyer I want to be able to provide a rating for a seller so that I can share my feedback on the seller's performance.
As a user I want to be able to initiate a chat with a seller so that I can communicate directly with the seller for inquiries, clarifications, or negotiations.

As a registered user, I want to be able to report a post created by another user so that I can bring attention to inappropriate content, policy violations, or other issues.
As an Administrator, I want to be able to create a new category so that I can organize products and posts effectively.
As an Administrator, I want to be able to update an existing category so that I can modify category details and keep the system organized.
As an Administrator, I want to be able to delete an existing category so that I can remove unnecessary or outdated categories from the system.
As an Administrator, I want to be able to approve a submitted post so that I can ensure that only valid and appropriate posts are visible on the platform.
As an Administrator, I want to be able to reject a submitted post so that I can ensure that inappropriate or non-compliant posts are not displayed on the platform.
As an Administrator, I want to be able to ban a user account so that I can prevent a user from accessing the platform due to violations or inappropriate behavior.
As an Administrator, I want to be able to update a legal document so that I can ensure that the platform's legal information is accurate and up-to-date.
As a Customer Service Representative, I want to be able to update content in the Help Center so that I can ensure that users have accurate and helpful information to address their queries.
As a Customer Service Representative, I want to be able to manage and respond to user feedback so that I can address user concerns, gather valuable insights, and improve the overall user experience

